<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Affiliate Disclosure - Kosmos</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include("../partials/public_header") %>
    <main class="container my-5" style="max-width: 800px;">
        <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
        <p class="text-muted">Last updated: <%= updated %></p>

        <p>Kosmos is free to use. Some links on this site are affiliate links, which means we may earn a commission if you buy through them, at no extra cost to you.</p>

        <h4 class="mt-4">Where you will see them</h4>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Packing list and packing guide:</strong> links to shop for items on Amazon.</li>
            <li><strong>Itinerary:</strong> links to browse tours and activities for your destination.</li>
            <li><strong>Trip page:</strong> links to compare travel insurance.</li>
            <li><strong>Driving time tool:</strong> links to rental car options.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>Affiliate links are marked and open in a new tab. We link to products and services we think are relevant to the trip you are planning, and a commission does not change the price you pay.</p>

        <p><strong>As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.</strong></p>

        <p>Questions about this disclosure? <a href="/contact">Contact us</a>.</p>
    </main>
    <%- include("../partials/public_footer") %>
</body>
</html>
